{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "operation": "rebase",
  "case": "same-row-conflict",
  "description": "The draft starts from version 1 and renames tier 3. Version 2, now active, renamed tier 3 too. The operation touches a row that changed in between, so the rebase refuses with V42 and names the row. Nothing merges silently: the AI rebuilds the draft on version 2.",
